sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as rhods-operator
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant API as kube-apiserver<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Mod as kserve-module-controller
    participant WH as kserve-webhook-server-service<br/>443→9443/TCP HTTPS service-CA
    participant Ctrl as kserve-controller
    participant SI as storage-initializer<br/>+ kserve-decrypt
    participant Store as S3/GCS/Azure/HF/OCI<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CDH as CoCo CDH<br/>127.0.0.1:8006 HTTP
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as llm-d EPP<br/>gRPC ext-proc TLS
    participant Pred as Predictor / vLLM pods<br/>8080 (ISVC) / 8000 (LLMISVC)

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Op,Mod: Flow 1 - Platform install via kserve-module
    Op->>API: Create Kserve default-kserve<br/>SA token
    Mod->>API: Watch Kserve, ConfigMap, Node, RuntimeClass
    Mod->>Mod: Render /opt/manifests-template (filesystem)
    Mod->>API: SSA CRDs, Deployments, webhooks, RBAC,<br/>CSRs, LLMISVC configs, dashboards
    Mod->>API: Update Kserve.status conditions/releases
    end

    rect rgb(235, 250, 235)
    Note over User,Pred: Flow 2 - InferenceService deployment (RawDeployment)
    User->>API: Create InferenceService<br/>User token
    API->>WH: Mutate/validate ISVC (failurePolicy Fail)
    WH-->>API: Admission response
    Ctrl->>API: Create Deployment, Service, HPA/KEDA,<br/>HTTPRoute/Route (SA token)
    API->>WH: /mutate-pods (inject storage-initializer,<br/>agent, metrics aggregator)
    SI->>Store: Download model artifacts<br/>Storage secret, TLS 1.2+
    Store-->>SI: Model files → /mnt/models
    Client->>GW: Inference request HTTPS/443<br/>Gateway auth policy
    GW->>Pred: Forward HTTP/h2c 8080<br/>(TLS at gateway)
    Pred-->>GW: Prediction
    GW-->>Client: Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over Client,Pred: Flow 3 - LLMInferenceService request
    Client->>GW: HTTPS/443<br/>Kuadrant AuthPolicy (external)
    GW->>EPP: ext-proc endpoint pick (gRPC, TLS)
    EPP-->>GW: Selected decode/prefill endpoint
    GW->>Pred: HTTPS 8000 (LLMISVC TLS default on)
    Pred-->>GW: Completion
    GW-->>Client: Response
    end

    rect rgb(250, 235, 245)
    Note over SI,CDH: Flow 4 - Confidential model load
    SI->>Store: Fetch encrypted model HTTPS/443
    SI->>CDH: Get key kbs:///... (loopback in TEE)<br/>TEE attestation to KBS
    CDH-->>SI: Decryption key
    SI->>SI: JWE A*KW/dir + A*GCM decrypt → /mnt/models
    end
